     by default. Set ``keep_points_with_nan_confidence=False`` to drop them
     instead.
 
+    To retain explicitly edited points while dropping other points with
+    missing confidence, pass the dataset's ``edited`` variable and set
+    ``keep_points_with_nan_confidence=False``. An edit flag records a manual
